From 5bc1e23411b066de880e047347dcf2da42215a0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 17 Feb 2026 16:29:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Remove unused GrapheneOS apps from build

Remove apps and APEXes that are not useful for GSI builds:
- Auditor: relies on hardware attestation tied to specific device
  models and will never pass verification on a GSI
- PdfViewerGOS: can easily be installed from the app store
- InfoApp: not relevant for GSI builds
- DeviceDiagnostics: GrapheneOS hardware diagnostics, cannot
  properly detect hardware on a GSI
- EasterEgg: novelty app, not needed
- HardeningTestApp: debug/testing app, not for production
- com.android.virt: pKVM virtualization APEX, requires
  Pixel-specific firmware support not available on GSI targets

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000003
---
 target/product/base_system.mk     | 2 --
 target/product/handheld_product.mk | 3 ---
 target/product/handheld_system.mk  | 2 --
 3 files changed, 7 deletions(-)

